---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---

<Base
  title="Privacy Policy - Konstantin Suvorov"
  windowTitle="Privacy"
  description="How konsu.dev handles your data: email signups, analytics and your rights."
>
  <section class="panel prose">
    <h2 class="section-title" style="margin-top:18px;">Privacy Policy</h2>
    <p><em>Last updated: October 18, 2026</em></p>

    <p>
      This is the personal website of Konstantin Suvorov. I'm responsible for any personal data collected here.
      If you have a question or request about your data, email me at <a href="mailto:hey@konsu.dev">hey@konsu.dev</a>.
    </p>

    <h3>Email signups</h3>
    <p>
      When you sign up to get a free download (like the Final Cut Pro effects), I collect your <strong>email address</strong>.
      In exchange for the free download, you join my email list. I use it to send you the occasional email about new tools
      and products I release. I don't sell or share your email with anyone else.
    </p>
    <p>
      The list is managed by <a href="https://kit.com" rel="noopener">Kit</a> (Kit, Inc.), which stores the data on my behalf,
      including in the United States. Kit also records basic signup details (such as the time and the form you used) and
      whether emails are opened or links are clicked. See <a href="https://kit.com/privacy" rel="noopener">Kit's privacy policy</a>.
    </p>
    <p>
      <strong>Legal basis:</strong> your consent when you sign up. You can withdraw it anytime with the unsubscribe link at the
      bottom of every email, or by emailing me. I keep your email until you unsubscribe or ask me to delete it.
    </p>

    <h3>Analytics</h3>
    <p>
      I use <a href="https://umami.is" rel="noopener">Umami</a>, a privacy-friendly analytics tool, to see which pages are visited
      and which buttons are clicked. It doesn't use cookies, doesn't track you across websites and doesn't collect personal data.
    </p>

    <h3>Other things on this site</h3>
    <ul>
      <li>The site is hosted on GitHub Pages, which may keep standard server logs (like IP addresses) for security.</li>
      <li>Embedded YouTube videos use YouTube's privacy-enhanced mode (youtube-nocookie.com).</li>
      <li>Your light/dark theme choice is saved in your browser only and never sent to me.</li>
    </ul>

    <h3>Your rights</h3>
    <p>
      You can ask me to show you, correct or delete the data I have about you, or to stop emailing you. Just email
      <a href="mailto:hey@konsu.dev">hey@konsu.dev</a>. If you're in the EU or UK, you also have the right to complain to your
      local data protection authority.
    </p>
  </section>
</Base>
